# infrastructure/iac — state-file ignore patterns (defense-in-depth).
#
# PRD 06 B-3 commits NO IaC state and NO executable IaC. These patterns are preventive: if a later,
# separately-gated phase introduces OpenTofu/Terraform, state and variable files (which can contain
# resolved secrets and provider/account identifiers) MUST NEVER be committed (D-14; DB3-4: no committed
# state files; local/non-production state only). Documentation examples (*.md) are intentionally NOT ignored.

*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.terraform/
.terraform.lock.hcl
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
